{"id":"huntik:page:7333","page_id":7333,"title":"The Seer's Tower","kind":"supporting_page","namespace":0,"summary":"The Seer's Tower was a mission assigned to Dante Vale by Metz to investigate Organization activity in Salon, France, in Nostradamus' tower. After evading an Organization aircraft's seeker missiles and destroying the plane, the Huntik Team is able to free the hostages from the museum, Peter, Billie and another female operative. The team, making use of Nostradamus' magic and Sentry Triclops Titans, is able to expel the Organization members, headed by Wilder, from the tower in order to secure Nostradamus' looking glass and the next clue to the island of Avalon. [The Tower of Nostradamus]","profile":{"location":{"text":"Tower of Nostradamus\nSalon, France","wikitext":"[[Tower of Nostradamus]] <br> [[Salon, France]]","links":[{"target_title":"Tower of Nostradamus","label":"Tower of Nostradamus","target_id":"huntik:page:7427","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_of_Nostradamus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7427"},{"target_title":"Salon, France","label":"Salon, France","target_id":"huntik:page:18334","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Salon%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Salon%2C%20France"}]},"image":{"text":"File:The_Seer's_Tower.jpg","wikitext":"File:The_Seer's_Tower.jpg","links":[]},"objectives":{"text":"Intercept the Organization\nPrevent them from raiding Nostradamus' observatory","wikitext":"{{*}} Intercept [[the Organization]]<br> {{*}} Prevent them from raiding [[Nostradamus|Nostradamus']] observatory","links":[{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Nostradamus","label":"Nostradamus'","target_id":"huntik:page:6911","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Nostradamus","status":"resolve